    "message": "[ipa-delivery:676] build(delivery): request the private IPA676 delivery\n\nFrozen at c7d90aa4.\n- RPCS3 Core 905 (pin 571e3eee, run 42265781315) replaces Core 903:\n  - the JIT arena is searched up to the task maximum address, so RPCS3\n    games start again on iOS 27 beta; the host escrow side is 5680f926;\n  - the complete native Metal 4 renderer, opt-in per title.\n- MeloNX Core 677 (pin 87948fb5, run 42269541984) replaces Core 673: side\n  cache during checkpoints, and evicted GPU buffers recreated.\nBase: the delivered 674 (run 42254239320). Dry-run freeze passed. Recipient\nkey 676: public half only.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012mUAShv9k6pSCnpW7oAF63",
